#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/3-ocs2_wbc.md:20
#: bbd621fc56e64cb4b752f960a531be63
msgid ""
"There is no public README listing a `ros2 launch ocs2_wbc_controller …` "
"entry point. The in-tree path that loads this controller is:"
msgstr "公开 README 没有列出 `ros2 launch ocs2_wbc_controller …` 入口。仓库内加载该控制器的路径是："

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/3-ocs2_wbc.md:22
#: ce9965847ffd46ad9714eba4a96ee58e
msgid "ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller full_body.launch.py robot:=<robot>"
msgstr "ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller full_body.launch.py robot:=<robot>"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/3-ocs2_wbc.md:26
#: aee135a5b98747d0b2d6de6bfaf098b9
msgid ""
"`full_body.launch.py` (`launch_mode` `full_body`) spawns "
"`ocs2_wbc_controller` when the robot’s `controller_manager` type is "
"`ocs2_wbc_controller/Ocs2WbcController`."
msgstr ""
"当机器人 `controller_manager` 的 type 为 "
"`ocs2_wbc_controller/Ocs2WbcController` "
"时，`full_body.launch.py`（`launch_mode` 为 `full_body`）会拉起 "
"`ocs2_wbc_controller`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/3-ocs2_wbc.md:28
#: cc64e82e7ccc41c682be21bde2c064f7
msgid ""
"The same file declares `type` and "
"`create_robot_profile_launch_arguments()` (`left_type` / `right_type`, "
"`use_profile_eef`). End-effectors: [OCS2 Arm "
"Controller](2-ocs2_arm_controller.md) and "
"[robot_common_launch](../descriptions/2-common.md)."
msgstr ""
"同一文件还声明 `type` 和 `create_robot_profile_launch_arguments()`（`left_type` / "
"`right_type`、`use_profile_eef`）。末端：[OCS2 Arm "
"Controller](2-ocs2_arm_controller.md) 与 "
"[robot_common_launch](../descriptions/2-common.md)。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/3-ocs2_wbc.md:30
#: deda958be9b347c58299d2bd903b04a7
msgid ""
"`split_body.launch.py` is the split (分体) path; whole-body control uses "
"`full_body.launch.py`."
msgstr "`split_body.launch.py` 是分体路径；全身控制用 `full_body.launch.py`。"

